NOTE: 

The command 

  mesh_confined_cylinder < meshinput1.txt

generates the mesh for cylinder1 and cylinder2

cylinder_post is the post_processing programs for cylinder1 and cylinder2

streamfunction is for cylinder1--cylinder2

The examples in this directory are described in the userguide.


Short description
-----------------

cylinder1:

 2D viscoelastic problem: flow around a cylinder confined between two walls.
 The problem uses a TFEM generated mesh.
 DEVSS-G/SUPG
 FENE-P model

cylinder2:

 2D viscoelastic problem: flow around a cylinder confined between two walls.
 The problem uses a TFEM generated mesh.
 DEVSS/DG
 FENE-P model

